"┌ Help — tachy 0.1.0 ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐"
"│ Normal · Navigation                                  Normal · Output                                      Inspector                                          │"
"│ h ←     move the cursor left                         y                copy the cell (full value)          Tab          next panel                            │"
"│ j ↓     move the cursor down                         Y                copy the row as delimited text      Esc          back to the table                     │"
"│ k ↑     move the cursor up                           e                export the view                     j ↓          next field                            │"
"│ l →     move the cursor right                        copies use OSC 52: the terminal must support it      k ↑          previous field                        │"
"│ ctrl-d  half a page down                             (tmux: set -g allow-passthrough on)                  Enter        show the full value                   │"
"│ ctrl-u  half a page up                                                                                    other keys work as in Normal                       │"
"│ PgDn    one page down                                Normal · Jobs & app                                  Inspector · value popup                            │"
"│ PgUp    one page up                                  J                toggle the jobs drawer              PgDn         one page down                         │"
"│ Home    go to the first row                          :                open the command palette            PgUp         one page up                           │"
"│ G       go to the last row (so far, while a filte…   ?                show the key bindings               Home         top                                   │"
"│ 0       go to the first column                       q ctrl-c ctrl-q  quit (confirms if jobs are runni…   G            bottom                                │"
"│ $       go to the last column                        ctrl-z           suspend to the shell                Esc Enter    close                                 │"
"│ w       next column (skips frozen)                   Esc              dismiss a message, cancel a pend…   j ↓          scroll down                           │"
"│ b       previous column (skips frozen)                                                                    k ↑          scroll up                             │"
"│ g       go to a row, N% or a column name             Filter / search                                                                                         │"
"│                                                      Enter            apply                               Detected format                                    │"
"│ Normal · Tabs & files                                Esc              cancel input, or the running scan   Enter        accept                                │"
"│ 1–9     switch to tab N                              ↑                previous history entry              Esc          revert to the sniffed format          │"
"│ ctrl-o  open a file in a new tab                     ↓                next history entry                  d            try the next delimiter                │"
"│ ctrl-w  close the current tab                        Tab              complete a column name / keyword    h            toggle the header row                 │"
"│ R       reload the file from disk                    ctrl-s           save as a named view (filter)       q            try the next quote char               │"
"│                                                                                                           r            show the raw lines of the file        │"
"│ Normal · Find                                        Command palette                                                                                         │"
"│ /       search                                       Enter            run                                 Column chooser                                     │"
"│ n       next search match                            Esc              close                               Enter        apply and close                       │"
"│ N       previous search match                        Tab              fill the arguments                  Esc          discard the changes and close         │"
"│ f       new filter                                   ↓                select the next item                j ↓          select the next column                │"
"│ F       refine the current filter                    ↑                select the previous item            k ↑          select the previous column            │"
"│ x       pop the current view                                                                              Space        show or hide the column               │"
"│ Enter   filtered/sorted view: jump to the source …   Jobs drawer                                          J shift-↓    move the column down                  │"
"│                                                      Tab Esc          back to the table                   K shift-↑    move the column up                    │"
"│ Normal · Sort & columns                              j ↓              select the next job                 a            show every column                     │"
"│ s       sort by the current column, ascending        k ↑              select the previous job             /            filter the list by name               │"
"│ S       sort by the current column, descending       p                pause or resume the job             Column chooser · filtering                         │"
"│ c       show, hide and reorder columns               K                kill the job                        Enter        keep the filter                       │"
"│ <       shrink the current column                    d                dismiss the finished job            Esc          clear the filter                      │"
"│ >       grow the current column                      focus it with Tab; other keys work as in Normal      ↑ ↓          move the selection                    │"
"│ =       auto-fit the current column                                                                       other keys   edit the filter                       │"
"│                                                                                                                                                              │"
"│ Normal · Inspect                                                                                          Export dialog                                      │"
"│ i       toggle the inspector                                                                              Enter        export                                │"
"│ Tab     move focus to the next panel                                                                      Esc          close                                 │"
"│                                                                                                           Tab          complete the path                     │"
"│ query:  == != < <= > >=  ~ regex  contains starts ends  "x"i case-insensitive  in [..]  is [not] null  && || !  and or not  `col name`  $1                   │"
"│ goto:  g 50%  = the middle of the file by bytes while indexing,  the middle row once indexed                                                                 │"
